# Database

PostgreSQL is the system of record. Match `docs/architecture/database-schema.md`.

On a schema change: model, migration, repository, then that doc. A hard-to-reverse choice also gets an ADR.

`vehicles` holds a UUID `id`, a unique `vin`, `model_id`, `entered_on`, nullable `stocked_out_on`, nullable `proposed_action`, and nullable `primary_image_key`. Stock state is whether `stocked_out_on` is null. Image bytes stay in MinIO.
